stical claims well-supported? Any issues with multiple comparisons, effect sizes, confidence intervals?\n5. **Specific weaknesses/strengths in methods and experiments**\n\nOutput format:\n```\n## R1 Review: Methods & Experiments\n\n### Summary\n[2-3 sentences]\n\n### Strengths\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Weaknesses  \n[Numbered list]\n\n### Questions for Authors\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Missing Experiments / Methodological Gaps\n[If any]\n\n### Preliminary Scores\n- Soundness: X/5\n- Excitement: X/5\n- Overall: X/5\n- Confidence: X/5\n\n### Justification\n[Brief justification for scores]\n```\n","uuid":"ea120448-0f23-44ca-81b4-d9ea8d465d91","session_id":"2dbb1532-cce8-453c-a0ba-ff5d2a8428c3"}
