{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019LCKceXUDdDSUBeTpFXRYh","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp_022_seed789 | 3rd seed SciERC inference (seed=789) with ft_002_v2 (Qwen3-8B). N=8, T=1.0, joint NER+RE, logprobs collected. Complements seed42 (exp_012_rerun_1024) and seed123/456 for multi-seed analysis. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_vc_lp_cascade_selection** (killed): VC-filtered LP selection cascade: test if combining VC (pre-filter) + LP (rank) improves selection F1 over single-signal selection. Addresses SF3 reviewer suggestion. Pure analysis on existing data.\\\\n- **exp_tacred_re_benchmark** (killed): TACRED RE benchmark: replicate SciERC RE experiment flow on second RE dataset. Verify correlation-selection gap generalizes beyond SciERC. D104 highest priority — addresses R11 MF1 consensus weakness.\\\\n- **exp_entity_token_lp** (negative): Entity-token LP: test Discussion hypothesis (d) format-token dilution. Re-inference with per-token logprobs, then compute entity-only LP variance and selection F1. If entity-token LP compression is reduced → pilot remedy for LP selection. Also includes LP z-score normalization as zero-cost baseline. Addresses SF2+SF3 from Round 12.\\\\n  [exp_entity_token_lp_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/exp_entity_token_lp/data/results.json) | [exp_entity_token_lp_report](/api/workspace-files/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/exp_entity_token_lp/report/report.md)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 61 / 负向 24 / 失败 4 / 共 111\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 