'InstructUIE: Multi-task Instruction Tuning for Unified Information Extraction'\\\\n    authors:\\\\n    - Xiao Wang\\\\n    - Weikang Zhou\\\\n    - Can Zu\\\\n    - Han Xia\\\\n    - Tianze Chen\\\\n    - Yuansen Zhang\\\\n    - Rui Zheng\\\\n    - Junjie Ye\\\\n    - Qi Zhang\\\\n    - Tao Gui\\\\n    - Jihua Kang\\\\n    - Jingsheng Yang\\\\n    - Siyuan Li\\\\n    - Chunsai Du\\\\n    year: 2023\\\\n    venue: arXiv preprint\\\\n    url: https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.08085\\\\n    doi: ''\\\\n    bibtex_key: wang2023instructuie\\\\n    category: generative_ie\\\\n    role: foundation\\\\n    relevance: 'Unified instruction-tuned IE framework covering NER, RE, EE across 32 datasets. Demonstrates multi-task generative\\\\n      IE with instruction tuning, directly relevant as representative LLM-based unified IE system.'\\\\n    abstract: ''\\\\n    semantic_scholar_id: ''\\\\n    verified: true\\\\n    added_by: paper-agent:manual\\\\n    added_at: '2026-05-14T22:00:00.000Z'\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 43664, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012j9aktZf9LgbHXUUEJq1rH","session_id":"2dbb1532-cce8-453c-a0ba-ff5d2a8428c3","uuid":"78ca1a72-b5bf-4f91-a149-5220582c08e1","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:18:28.790Z"}
